{"frases": [{"a": 0, "b": 1.925, "t": "Don't trust your cat's favorite plant.", "k": ["favorite"], "w": [0.056, 0.314, 0.621, 0.879, 1.137, 1.593]}, {"a": 1.925, "b": 5.748, "t": "Everyone thinks the plant called catnip just makes cats go crazy for fun.", "k": ["Everyone"], "w": [1.975, 2.431, 2.788, 2.997, 3.304, 3.661, 4.018, 4.276, 4.583, 4.841, 5.0, 5.307, 5.516]}, {"a": 5.748, "b": 7.716, "t": "But that's only half the story.", "k": ["that's"], "w": [5.798, 6.007, 6.314, 6.572, 6.83, 7.038]}, {"a": 7.716, "b": 8.482999999999999, "t": "You've seen it.", "k": ["You've"], "w": [7.766, 8.061, 8.309]}, {"a": 8.482999999999999, "b": 10.616, "t": "A cat sniffs catnip, rubs its face on it,", "k": ["catnip,"], "w": [8.533, 8.637, 8.837, 9.18, 9.594, 9.842, 10.042, 10.29, 10.442]}, {"a": 10.616, "b": 12.085999999999999, "t": "and rolls on the floor.", "k": ["floor."], "w": [10.666, 10.866, 11.161, 11.313, 11.513]}, {"a": 12.085999999999999, "b": 16.206, "t": "In 2021, scientists in Japan wanted to know why cats do that.", "k": ["2021,"], "w": [12.136, 12.304, 13.082, 13.671, 13.839, 14.165, 14.544, 14.712, 14.985, 15.206, 15.48, 15.648]}, {"a": 16.206, "b": 18.778, "t": "They studied catnip and a similar plant, silver vine,", "k": ["studied"], "w": [16.256, 16.492, 16.863, 17.189, 17.379, 17.479, 17.85, 18.199, 18.525]}, {"a": 18.778, "b": 20.820999999999998, "t": "and found the chemical that sets cats off.", "k": ["chemical"], "w": [18.828, 19.019, 19.3, 19.49, 19.906, 20.142, 20.377, 20.613]}, {"a": 20.820999999999998, "b": 23.636, "t": "It switches on the pleasure system in the cat's brain.", "k": ["switches"], "w": [20.871, 21.016, 21.433, 21.578, 21.768, 22.185, 22.511, 22.656, 22.846, 23.081]}, {"a": 23.636, "b": 24.898, "t": "So yes, it feels good.", "k": ["feels"], "w": [23.686, 23.848, 24.135, 24.297, 24.61]}, {"a": 24.898, "b": 27.096, "t": "For about five to fifteen minutes.", "k": ["minutes."], "w": [24.948, 25.16, 25.473, 25.735, 25.897, 26.31]}, {"a": 27.096, "b": 28.686, "t": "Now the other half of the story,", "k": ["story,"], "w": [27.146, 27.337, 27.529, 27.811, 28.048, 28.194, 28.385]}, {"a": 28.686, "b": 30.896, "t": "the one almost every cat owner misses.", "k": ["misses."], "w": [28.736, 28.928, 29.119, 29.447, 29.73, 29.921, 30.204]}, {"a": 30.896, "b": 32.437000000000005, "t": "The scientists noticed something.", "k": ["scientists"], "w": [30.946, 31.129, 31.618, 31.977]}, {"a": 32.437000000000005, "b": 33.813, "t": "The cats weren't just playing.", "k": ["playing."], "w": [32.487, 32.671, 32.898, 33.212, 33.439]}, {"a": 33.813, "b": 36.536, "t": "They were rubbing the plant onto their face and head.", "k": ["rubbing"], "w": [33.863, 34.09, 34.317, 34.675, 34.858, 35.129, 35.356, 35.627, 35.854, 36.037]}, {"a": 36.536, "b": 38.236000000000004, "t": "So they brought in mosquitoes.", "k": ["mosquitoes."], "w": [36.586, 36.728, 36.959, 37.324, 37.466]}, {"a": 38.236000000000004, "b": 39.644000000000005, "t": "Cats that had rubbed on the plant", "k": ["rubbed"], "w": [38.286, 38.493, 38.7, 38.867, 39.153, 39.28, 39.447]}, {"a": 39.644000000000005, "b": 41.646, "t": "got far fewer mosquitoes landing on them.", "k": ["mosquitoes"], "w": [39.694, 39.861, 40.028, 40.275, 40.72, 41.046, 41.174]}, {"a": 41.646, "b": 44.410000000000004, "t": "The same chemical that excites the cat keeps the bugs away.", "k": ["chemical"], "w": [41.696, 41.881, 42.11, 42.516, 42.745, 43.107, 43.292, 43.477, 43.75, 43.936, 44.165]}, {"a": 44.410000000000004, "b": 47.166000000000004, "t": "And the leopards and jaguars in the study did it too.", "k": ["leopards"], "w": [44.46, 44.645, 44.831, 45.236, 45.421, 45.783, 45.924, 46.109, 46.382, 46.568, 46.709]}, {"a": 47.166000000000004, "b": 48.491, "t": "So it's not just a party.", "k": ["party."], "w": [47.216, 47.375, 47.583, 47.791, 48.049, 48.159]}, {"a": 48.491, "b": 50.826, "t": "Your cat may be putting on bug spray.", "k": ["putting"], "w": [48.541, 48.799, 49.007, 49.215, 49.374, 49.7